# Store & Hooks

## Zustand

- Middleware: `devtools(persist(analytics(impl)))`
- Persist via `partialize`: `bestScore`, settings, theme only — never active board
- Selectors at call site: `useGameStore(s => s.score)`
- History capped at 5; actions use `get()` for latest state
- Storage keys use `mergefinity:` prefix from constants

## Hooks

- Return data/callbacks — never JSX
- May import store + engine; never components
- Gestures: worklet `onEnd` → `runOnJS(handler)` — never call store from worklet
- Split if hook >80 lines
- Every custom hook needs a test
